# libpdx-argv deps.list
#
# Wave:  R49
# Doc:   design/tooling/r49-r50-plan.md §5.12 in paideia-os.
#
# libpdx-argv has NO library dependencies (per §5.12 "libpdx-argv.M1 has
# no library dependencies (pure userspace)"). Its M3 wire-schema shape
# is *coordinated* with libpdx-semantic-pipe (`PdxArgvRecord@0.1`) but
# the alternate-invocation code path in src/schema_invoke.pdx decodes
# the on-wire record itself; it does not link against libpdx-semantic-
# pipe symbols.
#
# Format (mirrors design/tooling/plan.md §6.4 `deps.list` shape):
#   <name>  <semver-lo>..<semver-hi>  <link-kind>
# link-kind is one of: static, dynamic, shape.
#
# (No library entries.)

# Toolchain floor (informational; enforced by pkg-install, not link):
toolchain:paideia-as   >= 0.33-crypto-kdf   build
